                <text type="synoptic_situation">A weak pressure gradient persists over the Gulf waters.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="QLD_FA003" description="North Queensland" type="sub-region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-11-28T17:00:00+10:00" end-time-local="2026-12-03T00:00:00+10:00" start-time-utc="2026-11-28T07:00:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-12-02T14:00:00Z">
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A weak ridge extends over the coastal waters. A weakening trough will cross the Mackay waters on Monday, followed by a new ridge. The ridge will strengthen on Tuesday as a high moves into the Tasman Sea.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="QLD_FA004" description="South Queensland" type="sub-region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-11-28T17:00:00+10:00" end-time-local="2026-12-03T00:00:00+10:00" start-time-utc="2026-11-28T07:00:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-12-02T14:00:00Z">
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A ridge extends over the coastal waters. A trough will cross the coastal waters early on Monday. A new ridge will extend over the coastal waters behind the trough on Monday. A high will move into the Tasman Sea on Tuesday, maintaining the ridge.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
